Capability: Sub-25ms Read Latency SLA via Write-Through Memory Cache
  Rule: For ANY feature that lists or searches todo tasks, serve results from an in-memory read cache under 25ms p99.

  Scenario: Cached task list retrieval
    Given a user's todo list has been viewed once
    When subsequent list queries arrive without changes
    Then the response is served directly from the in-memory read cache under 25ms
